      "q": "Who has got my ears?",
      "a": "Are these animals looking funny? The artist has drawn wrong ears on the heads of the animals. Give correct ears to the animals in the space given below.\nAnimal\nEar\nElephant\nMouse\nDog\nRabbit\nBuffalo\nDeer\nMouse\nGiraffe\nGiraffe\nElephant"
